---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'May 2026';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Chillax Creek"
  description="Terms and conditions for using the Chillax Creek website and booking a stay at the cabin."
>
  <section class="home-sec1" style="padding-top: 60px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <h6 class="red-heading">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</h6>
          <h2>Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
          <p>
            These terms and conditions govern your use of the Chillax Creek website
            (chillaxcreek.com) and your booking of a stay at the property. By accessing this site
            or completing a booking, you agree to these terms.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-sec4">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <h3>1. About this site</h3>
          <p>
            This website is operated by the owners of Chillax Creek, a short-term vacation rental
            located in Blue Ridge, Fannin County, Georgia, USA. References to &ldquo;we,&rdquo;
            &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo; refer to the property owners. References to
            &ldquo;you&rdquo; or &ldquo;guest&rdquo; refer to the visitor or booking party.
          </p>

          <h3>2. Bookings &amp; payment</h3>
          <p>
            Bookings are processed through our integrated booking provider (OwnerRez). Pricing,
            taxes, and cleaning fees are displayed before checkout. Payment is collected at the
            time of booking unless otherwise stated. By booking, you confirm that you are at least
            21 years old and authorized to make the reservation.
          </p>

          <h3>3. Cancellations &amp; refunds</h3>
          <p>
            The current cancellation policy is shown during the booking flow before payment.
            Refunds are issued according to the policy attached to your specific reservation.
            Refunds for cancellations due to weather, force majeure, or events outside our control
            are handled on a case-by-case basis.
          </p>

          <h3>4. House rules</h3>
          <p>
            All guests agree to follow the
            <a href="/rules-regulations/">house rules &amp; regulations</a>, which form part of
            these terms. Failure to follow them may result in early termination of the stay
            without refund and additional charges for damages.
          </p>

          <h3>5. Damage &amp; liability</h3>
          <p>
            Guests are responsible for damage caused during their stay beyond ordinary wear and
            tear. We recommend reviewing your booking platform&rsquo;s host protection policy and
            your own travel insurance for additional coverage. Use of the hot tub, fire pit, creek,
            and outdoor amenities is at the guest&rsquo;s own risk.
          </p>

          <h3>6. Intellectual property</h3>
          <p>
            Photos, copy, and design on this site are the property of Chillax Creek or used with
            permission. You may share or link to pages on this site for personal use, but please
            do not republish photos or content without our written consent.
          </p>

          <h3>7. Third-party services</h3>
          <p>
            This site embeds tools from third parties, including OwnerRez (booking and
            availability), Formspree (contact form delivery), and Trustindex (review display).
            Use of those services is governed by their respective terms.
          </p>

          <h3>8. Limitation of liability</h3>
          <p>
            To the fullest extent permitted by Georgia law, we are not liable for any indirect,
            incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this site or stay at the
            property.
          </p>

          <h3>9. Governing law</h3>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by the laws of the State of Georgia, USA. Any dispute arising
            out of or related to these terms or your stay will be handled in the courts of Fannin
            County, Georgia.
          </p>

          <h3>10. Contact</h3>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms? <a href="/contact-us/">Get in touch</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
